# The Horutoto Ruins Experiment (Windurst 1-1): Windurst Woods. A level 10 Warrior of Windurst (Resonance current).
# Section 1: Rakoh Buuma plays 121; its finish with option 1 begins the mission (the Woods title). Section 2 (1-1
# current): Miiri-Wohri 124, Rakoh Buuma 127, Sola Jaab 125, Tih Pikeh 126. Completed (a GM): section 7: Miiri-Wohri
# plays 115, Sola Jaab 130, Tih Pikeh 131.
# Rival zone-in: entering Windurst Woods plays the Seekers of Adventure mission Rumors from the West, 839 (another
# mission's script, not this one); its finish writes that mission's status 4 (area 12).
lists WindurstWoods/Rakoh_Buuma/onTrigger WindurstWoods/Miiri-Wohri/onTrigger WindurstWoods/Sola_Jaab/onTrigger WindurstWoods/Tih_Pikeh/onTrigger WindurstWoods/onEventFinish/121
char zone=WindurstWoods pos=108,-5,-24 job=WAR lvl=10 nation=2
mission Rov Resonance current
login
trigger Rakoh_Buuma                     # section 1: 121
finish option=1                         # begun (the Woods title, status 1)
trigger Miiri-Wohri                     # section 2: 124
finish
trigger Rakoh_Buuma                     # 127
finish
trigger Sola_Jaab                       # 125
finish
trigger Tih_Pikeh                       # 126
finish
mission Windurst TheHorutotoRuinsExperiment completed   # a GM
trigger Miiri-Wohri                     # section 7: 115
finish
trigger Sola_Jaab                       # 130
finish
trigger Tih_Pikeh                       # 131
finish
